  "contract_index_rows": [
    "| `benchmark_payload` | `benchmark-payload:field-contract:2` | Research Benchmark CC | Scientific Evaluation CC, checking, Delivery CC | [research-benchmark.md](capsules/research-benchmark.md) |",
